OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-soaked site cancels charity
OL,4,Anight hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA waterlogged route and a forecast for
OL,7,Fmore heavy rain and strong winds have
OL,8,Fled to a charity calling off its
OL,9,Ffundraising night hike.
OL,11,FThe Sue Ryder Starlight Hike was set to
OL,12,Fsee about 300 people walk either 5k
OL,13,F(three miles) or 10k (six miles) around
OL,14,Fthe grounds of the Mapledurham Estate
OL,15,Fin Reading from 18:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
