OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-soaked site cancels charity
OL,4,Anight hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said cancelling the walk
OL,7,Fwas "a huge blow" as it was set to
OL,8,Fraise more than #50,000 for the charity
OL,9,Fwhich runs Sue Ryder Duchess of Kent
OL,10,FHospice in Reading and Sue Ryder
OL,11,FPalliative Care Hub in Wallingford,
OL,12,FSouth Oxfordshire.
OL,14,FWalkers who were set to take part are
OL,15,Fbeing asked to plan their own walk in
OL,16,Fmemory of a loved one at a time and
OL,17,Fplace that feels meaningful.
